Cell["\<\
The code might be faster as the more explicit x,y,z version of the code.  It \
might be faster with the parameters passed in to functions.  I think it will \
be faster if we do not do the sensitivity computation on the approach to \
asymptotic version.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9726347577139473`*^9, 
  3.972634958484988*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8316717a-9b0e-45f3-851e-\
0bc32ab7d4c0"],

